            "position": {
              "x": 640.0,
              "y": 32.0
            },
            "description": "Ring-modulated triangle carrier (Triangle + Ring Mod on): the triangle fold XORs with the ring input's MSB to generate the inharmonic ring sidebands. The tonal side of the per-frame tri↔noise alternation.",
            "parameters": {
              "clock": "pal",
